{"scene_description":"The image depicts the interior of a warehouse or storage facility. The space is filled with metal shelving units, which are arranged in rows and columns. These shelves are supported by green metal beams that extend from floor to ceiling. The shelves themselves are made of metal and have various heights, creating an uneven surface for the items stored on them.

On the shelves, there are numerous boxes and containers of different sizes and colors. Some of these containers appear to be plastic bins, while others seem to be cardboard boxes. The colors of the containers range from white to yellow, brown, and blue. The arrangement of the containers is somewhat haphazard, with some stacked on top of each other and others placed side by side.

In the background, there is a red vehicle parked near one of the shelving units. This vehicle appears to be a forklift or pallet jack, suggesting that this area is used for moving and organizing goods within the warehouse.

The floor of the warehouse is made of concrete, and the lighting is bright, illuminating the entire space evenly. The overall atmosphere of the warehouse suggests a busy, functional environment where goods are stored and organized before being shipped out or used in production."}

